{"title": "Jump", "pageid": 3630, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Jump", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Movement-expending actions", "Common actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Frog)\" title=\"Jump (Frog)\">Jump (Frog)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Running)\" title=\"Jump (Running)\">Jump (Running)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jump.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Jump.webp/300px-Jump.webp, /w/images/1/1f/Jump.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Jump.webp/300px-Jump.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Jump.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Jump</b>  is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> that allows characters to jump vertically or horizontally, up to a distance determined by their <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> score.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Jump to a destination. \n</p>\nYour <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> affects how far you can jump.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> + <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 3 m (10 ft) <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 4.5 m (15 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 4.5 m (15 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_Jump</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Jump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Jump\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/AddFallDamageOnLand_(spell_flag)\" title=\"AddFallDamageOnLand (spell flag)\">AddFallDamageOnLand</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsJump_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsJump (spell flag)\">IsJump</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Jumping can cause falling damage from heights of greater than 4 m (13 ft). Refer to <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">Falling damage</a> for details of how this damage is determined.</li>\n<li>Jumping from a height of around 8 m (27 ft) or higher will cause you to fall <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a> upon landing.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Encumbered (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Encumbered\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Encumbered (Condition)\">Encumbered</a> condition halves jump range, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Encumbered (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Encumbered\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Encumbered (Condition)\">Heavily Encumbered</a> inhibits it entirely</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind_(Condition)\" title=\"Step of the Wind (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Step of the Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Step_of_the_Wind_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind_(Condition)\" title=\"Step of the Wind (Condition)\">Step of the Wind</a> removes the <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> cost completely</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ways_to_increase\">Ways to increase</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Features &amp; Abilities:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/25px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/38px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/50px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/25px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> – Increases Jump distance by 1 m (3 ft) per 2 points above 10</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Advanced Unarmoured Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/25px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/38px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/50px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advanced Unarmoured Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/25px-Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Advanced Unarmoured Movement\">Advanced Unarmoured Movement</a> – Increases Jump distance by 6 m (20 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Athlete:_Standing_Up\" title=\"Athlete: Standing Up\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp/25px-Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp/38px-Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp/50px-Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Athlete\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp/25px-Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Athlete_Standing_Up_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Athlete:_Standing_Up\" title=\"Athlete: Standing Up\">Athlete</a> – Increases Jump distance by 50%</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage:_Tiger_Heart\" title=\"Rage: Tiger Heart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage: Tiger Heart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Tiger_Heart_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture